---
source: crates/motion-edit/src/../tests/unit/parse.rs
expression: "report.join(\"\\n\")"
---
`` → empty edit; expected `<target> <key>=<value>`
`fill=red` → no target before `fill=red`; expected a target first: a layer id or `scene`
`card` → no changes after `card`; expected `<key>=<value>`
`card at=center 666` → `666` is not a change; expected `<key>=<value>`, with quotes around a value that has spaces
`a"b x=1` → unexpected quote in `a"`; expected quotes only around a value, as in `<key>="<value>"`
`a "x"=1` → unexpected quote in `"`; expected quotes only around a value, as in `<key>="<value>"`
`a x"y=1` → unexpected quote in `x"`; expected quotes only around a value, as in `<key>="<value>"`
`a x=ab"c d"` → unexpected quote in `x=ab"c`; expected the whole value quoted: x="abc d"
`a x=ab"c d` → unexpected quote in `x=ab"c`; expected the whole value quoted: x="abc d"
`a x=ab"c"` → unexpected quote in `x=ab"c"`; expected the whole value quoted: x="abc"
`a x=1="2 3" y=4` → unexpected quote in `x=1="2`; expected the whole value quoted: x="1=2 3"
`a x=a"b\"c"` → unexpected quote in `x=a"b\"c"`; expected the whole value quoted: x="ab\"c"
`card delay+=10f` → operator `+=` is not supported yet; expected `<key>=<value>`
`a x-=1` → operator `-=` is not supported yet; expected `<key>=<value>`
`a =x` → missing key before `=` in `=x`; expected `<key>=<value>`
`a x$y=1` → invalid key `x$y`: each dot-separated part must be non-empty letters, digits, `-` or `_`; expected `<key>[.<key>…]=<value>`
`a anim..x=1` → invalid key `anim..x`: each dot-separated part must be non-empty letters, digits, `-` or `_`; expected `<key>[.<key>…]=<value>`
`a fill=` → missing value for `fill`; expected `fill=<value>`, or `fill=""` for an empty string
`a text="open` → unclosed quote in `text="open`; expected a closing `"`
`a x="b"c` → unexpected text after the closing quote in `x="b"c`; expected a space after the quote, or the whole value quoted
`a text="a\nb"` → unknown escape `\n` in a quoted value; expected `\"` or `\\`
`a text="a\` → dangling `\` at the end of a quoted value; expected `\"` or `\\`
`a x=[1, 2` → unclosed `[` in `x=[1, 2`; expected `<key>=[…]` or `<key>={…}`, valid JSON
`a x={"a":1` → unclosed `{` in `x={"a":1`; expected `<key>=[…]` or `<key>={…}`, valid JSON
`a x=[1,]` → invalid JSON in `x`: trailing comma at line 1 column 4; expected `<key>=[…]` or `<key>={…}`, valid JSON
`a x=[1}` → invalid JSON in `x`: expected `,` or `]` at line 1 column 3; expected `<key>=[…]` or `<key>={…}`, valid JSON
`a x=[1,"]" y=2` → invalid JSON in `x`: expected `,` or `]` at line 1 column 8; expected `<key>=[…]` or `<key>={…}`, valid JSON
`a x=[[[…]]]` → invalid JSON in `x`: recursion limit exceeded at line 1 column 128; expected `<key>=[…]` or `<key>={…}`, valid JSON
`a x=[1]y` → unexpected text after the end of the JSON value in `x=[1]y`; expected a space after the closing bracket
`a fill=red fill=blue` → key `fill` given twice
`card anim={} anim.x=1` → keys `anim` and `anim.x` overlap; set them in separate edits or merge them into one value
`card anim.x.y=1 anim.x=2` → keys `anim.x` and `anim.x.y` overlap; set them in separate edits or merge them into one value
`ghost fill=#FFF` → unknown layer id `ghost`; expected one of title, card
`card colour=#FFF` → unknown layer key `colour`; expected one of id, text, rect, shapes, comp, pivot, font, fill, at, in, anim, parent, span, offset, stretch, fx, hidden, anchor, scale, rotate, opacity
`scene colour=red` → unknown scene key `colour`; expected one of motion, size, fps, dur, bg, presets, comps, layers
`card in.opacity=1` → cannot set `in.opacity`: `in` is not an object
`title text=2024` → layers[0].text: invalid type: integer `2024`; expected a quoted value: `text="2024"`
`title text=true` → layers[0].text: invalid type: boolean `true`; expected a quoted value: `text="true"`
